<title>USA: Snyder Oil to offer $150 mln senior notes.</title>
<headline>Snyder Oil to offer $150 mln senior notes.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Snyder Oil Corp said Thursday it intends to offer $150 million of senior subordinated notes due 2007.</p>
<p>The company said it will offer the Notes under an existing shelf registration.</p>
<p>Snyder said it would use proceeds to redeem its existing convertible notes, to repay amounts outstanding under its revolving credit facility and for general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
